  "details": "Activating pickup objects that are disabled by default in a new instance causes lag for users in a world when someone new joins after awhile.\n\nIt is substantial and very bothersome.\n\n\n1. World has deactivated pickup game objects that are deactivated by default when a new instance is made\n2. Triggers activate those game objects.\n3. After some time, (Possibly 30-60 minutes, or a lot of new joiners) new joiners cause everyone to lag and stall as the new joiner syncs up with the world.",
